      "locked": false,
      "text": "Memory-brain\nA way to persist data\nBypass read-write layers and directly\nwrite in the local storage (disk)\nAll the events(data) of games is stored here",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
