      "updated": 1780085294688,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A virtual network stack managed by Docker\nCommunication channels between containers\nKeeps container traffic isolated or bridges them together\nExposes internal container applications to the host or internet\nIt is the stadium phone lines and intercom system for the players",
      "fontSize": 20.666666666666657,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A virtual network stack managed by Docker\nCommunication channels between containers\nKeeps container traffic isolated or bridges them together\nExposes internal container applications to the host or internet\nIt is the stadium phone lines and intercom system for the players",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yzU1Gpt7wS6Knge_vZZJk",
