    {
      "id": "yjGzY2ThCkQdlC11vZNGU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 952.335743044559,
      "y": 1878.3787617677515,
      "width": 417.8999938964844,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 121546908,
      "version": 548,
      "versionNonce": 25324828,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780086677188,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- change in a line, retriggers the execution\n    of lines below it.. Lines above it are fetched\n    from cached memory of prev build\n- efficient caching in layers must be done\n- copy . . : copies the entire current dir into the \n    curr dest dir\n- if def dir /app given: then all the actions will\n    operate in the app dir",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- change in a line, retriggers the execution\n    of lines below it.. Lines above it are fetched\n    from cached memory of prev build\n- efficient caching in layers must be done\n- copy . . : copies the entire current dir into the \n    curr dest dir\n- if def dir /app given: then all the actions will\n    operate in the app dir",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q7zG5hZgrT5s8oigIa61p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 903.5511412161335,
      "y": 2647.164473717103,
      "width": 431.70001220703125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0GV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1606420260,
      "version": 1270,
      "versionNonce": 1101854372,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780087253380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-switching to multistage builds, saves a lot of\n    memory of the docker conatiner\n- efficient caching \n- here, instead of copying the .ts files first, then \n    compiling them into .js file for processing\n    just increased our overhead.. \n    Whereas in multistage, we compile once and \n    then access them from build stage, saves us\n    hassle in the runner stage",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-switching to multistage builds, saves a lot of\n    memory of the docker conatiner\n- efficient caching \n- here, instead of copying the .ts files first, then \n    compiling them into .js file for processing\n    just increased our overhead.. \n    Whereas in multistage, we compile once and \n    then access them from build stage, saves us\n    hassle in the runner stage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UjqIy-vqna8RjURK1uAWh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 234.4575211520047,
      "y": 2984.1947528832256,
      "width": 1097.38330078125,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Gl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1676655908,
      "version": 1450,
      "versionNonce": 306311844,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780087266513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Multi-Stage Builds\n    A technique using multiple FROM statements in a single Dockerfile\n    Separates the heavy build environment from the final execution environment\n    Selectively copies only the necessary compiled files into the final image\n    Drastically reduces the overall image size and minimizes security vulnerabilities\n    It is building a complex game level in a massive developer studio, then shipping only the final game cartridge to players\nThe Compilation Advantage\n    Keeps bulky source code, compilers, and development tools out of production\n    Runs compilation tools (tsc) in a temporary throwaway container stage\n    Ships only the lightweight compiled output (.js files) to the final runtime\n    Speeds up deployment times and drastically reduces runtime resource overhead\n    It is baking a cake in a commercial kitchen with heavy machinery, but only serving the finished cake on a clean plate",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Multi-Stage Builds\n    A technique using multiple FROM statements in a single Dockerfile\n    Separates the heavy build environment from the final execution environment\n    Selectively copies only the necessary compiled files into the final image\n    Drastically reduces the overall image size and minimizes security vulnerabilities\n    It is building a complex game level in a massive developer studio, then shipping only the final game cartridge to players\nThe Compilation Advantage\n    Keeps bulky source code, compilers, and development tools out of production\n    Runs compilation tools (tsc) in a temporary throwaway container stage\n    Ships only the lightweight compiled output (.js files) to the final runtime\n    Speeds up deployment times and drastically reduces runtime resource overhead\n    It is baking a cake in a commercial kitchen with heavy machinery, but only serving the finished cake on a clean plate",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
